{"G": {"identity_effect": "NONE_FROM_COMPILATION", "primary_source_kind": "SEMANTIC_ARCHITECTURE", "review_state": "SOURCE_DECLARED_NOT_CORPUS_ADMITTED", "slug_standing": "REVIEWED_PROVISIONAL_REFERENCE", "standing": "EXPLORATORY_BUILDING"}, "definition": {"intension": "The reference stack has four zooms. RPZ0 LOCATE: machine identity codes for a coordinate, carrying no natural language and bijective with the id \u2014 I integer (CSIL), G glyph (SemCrys), H hash (integrity), U URI (interop). RPZ1 NAME: the BOUND-TERM \u2014 the natural-language renderings of the identity and its binding lattice \u2014 O orthographic (written variants), P phonetic (spoken), A acronym (abbreviated), plus aliases (synonyms), inflections, and the competing-binding/polysemy fan; GTK lives here. RPZ2: intension (definition/sense). RPZ3: the relational manifold. Rule: where language NAMES meaning, coordinates LOCATE it \u2014 renderings are RPZ1, encodings are RPZ0. A bound-term is not a word; it may be a proper noun or a many-named concept."}, "identity": {"D": {"concept_id": "ATLAS.STRUCTURE.DA0BB30C50B30175", "origin_class": "SOURCE_NATIVE_STRUCTURAL", "reader_domain": "semantics", "standing": "EXPLORATORY_BUILDING"}, "base_slug": "sp-rpz-01", "collision_status": "UNIQUE", "concept_id": "ATLAS.STRUCTURE.DA0BB30C50B30175", "rpz0": "SP-RPZ-01", "rpz1": "SP-RPZ-01", "slug": "sp-rpz-01", "title": "SP-RPZ-01"}, "identity_effect": "NONE_FROM_COMPILATION", "schema": "semcrys.documentation-concept-subset.v1", "snapshot_scope": "IDENTITY_DEFINITION_AND_STANDING_ONLY", "upstream_contract_sha256": "6A41917F0CE360C51684031A49D52E5A9AEC612BFE89AA31B24B212345936436"}
